<title>INDIA: Indian bond interest rates to fall 6 months-I-Sec.</title>
<headline>Indian bond interest rates to fall 6 months-I-Sec.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interest rates on three to five year Indian maturity bonds are expected to fall by 125 to 150 basis points over the next three to six months, ICICI Securities and Finance Company (I-Sec) said on Friday.</p>
</text>
